OL,3,GNEWSA'We saw bodies on the floor' after
OL,4,AKrakow shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British tourist who was in Krakow
OL,7,Fwith her partner said they saw bodies
OL,8,Fon the floor following the shooting on
OL,9,FSaturday.
OL,11,FDaisey Hersey, from Hove, said she was
OL,12,Fat a restaurant in the Polish city when
OL,13,Fshe heard what she later found out to
OL,14,Fbe gunshots and saw people seeking
OL,15,Fshelter inside with "fear on their
OL,16,Fface".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
