OL,3,GNEWSA'We saw bodies on the floor' after
OL,4,AKrakow shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnother British couple in the
OL,7,Frestaurant told Hersey they had seen
OL,8,Fpeople injured, but she said she did
OL,9,Fnot know what had happened until she
OL,10,Fleft the restaurant about 30 minutes
OL,11,Flater.
OL,13,F"We didn't know what was going on and
OL,14,Fas we walked we just saw bodies on the
OL,15,Ffloor and it was very disturbing," she
OL,16,Fexplained.
